[gd_scene format=3]

; The Drydock, west of the Strongroom: the keepers' dock under the sea-wall, drained and frozen, where their machines were
; laid up in the cradles. A trap (an Ambush): two of the laid-up machines stand as the pilgrim steps past either doorway,
; the gates falling behind and ahead, until both are broken. East: back into the Strongroom. West: on to the Breakwater.

[ext_resource type="Material" path="res://assets/materials/wet_stone.tres" id="1_wet_stone"]
